<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>TANKERS.</p>
<p>Sea Salvia - (built 1979) 88,396 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $10.6 million.</p>
<p>Global Eos - (built 1991) 8,057 dwt sold to Korean buyers for $10 million.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they maybe subject to inspection, survey or other conditions before completion.</p>
